Poll Menlo Oaks Scanner Telegram channel for HIGH/MEDIUM priority calls and GMRS Ch 6 traffic.

## Instructions

1. Use FactoryFactoryBot (`8456724618:AAG43YpwB6LtPBJzL-T6iP-D-T1WQalhRrs`) to poll the Menlo Oaks Scanner channel (`-1003727561803`)
2. Use `getUpdates` or check channel messages for new posts since last check
3. Read `memory/heartbeat-state.json` for `scanner_last_update_id` — only process updates after that ID
4. For each new message:

### GMRS/FRS Channel 6 (462.6875 MHz)
- If transcript is from Ch 6 / 462.6875 → forward the FULL transcript text to Group Research supergroup (`-1003803468720`) via FactoryFactoryBot
- Forward ALL Ch 6 traffic unconditionally, no keyword filter

### HIGH Priority (alert Ray immediately)
- Systems: MPKA (MPPD, APD, EPAPD), SMCSO TG 865/871-876/525-528/609
- Keywords: stolen, hot plate, stolen plate, stolen vehicle, burglary, 459, robbery, 211, armed, shots fired, 245, 246, 417, carjacking, 215, pursuit, active shooter, BOLO, 10-851, evading, code 3
- Location: Menlo, Colby, Oaks, Atherton, Sharon, Alameda de las Pulgas, Sand Hill, El Camino, Ravenswood
- If match → `notify_main_agent` with transcript + talkgroup + time AND Telegram DM to Ray (chat_id 8781372712)

### MEDIUM Priority (alert if near Menlo Park)
- Keywords: suspicious, prowler, trespass, vandal, catalytic, 602, 594, 10-31, 10-32, 10-33
- Only alert if location keywords also match
- If match → `notify_main_agent`

### SKIP
- EMS, hospital, fire dispatch, parks, SamTrans, jail, coroner, public works, building inspection

4. Update `scanner_last_update_id` in `memory/heartbeat-state.json`
5. If nothing matched → `nothing_to_report({})`
